Package: customersegmentationr
Type: Package
Title: Customer Segmentation Using R Programming
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An end-to-end data analytics project that cleans customer data,
    explores purchasing behaviour, selects the number of clusters with the
    elbow method and silhouette analysis, segments customers with k-means,
    profiles each segment and generates evidence-based marketing hypotheses.
    This file documents project metadata and package dependencies; the project
    is run with run_project.R and is not an installable R package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
